|  identity   +-------------+    +------+------+-------------+
|             |             |    |             | right-split |
|             | right-split |    |             |     n-1     |
|             |             |    |  identity   +-------------+
|             |     n-1     |    |             | right-split |
|             |             |    |             |     n-1     |
+-------------+-------------+    +-------------+-------------+

       right-split n                    corner-split n
